<section style="padding-top:40px">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="guide-toc">
      <h4>In this guide</h4>
      <a href="#what">What a round robin is</a>
      <a href="#formats">Singles, fixed pairs or rotating doubles</a>
      <a href="#draw">Drawing the fixture: the circle method</a>
